# NICER raw event files for the hfqpo-ladder NICER/LAXPC extension (~12 GB; refetched
# on demand by experiments/hfqpo-ladder/extension-nicer-laxpc/scripts/fetch_nicer.py --
# the small manifest/log JSONs stay tracked), plus the per-ObsID 16-s segment caches
# (~102 MB npz; regenerated by scripts/run_scan_ext.py stack)
experiments/hfqpo-ladder/extension-nicer-laxpc/data/raw/
experiments/hfqpo-ladder/extension-nicer-laxpc/results/cache/

# Macro-quantization discovery probe raw downloads (~26 MB; refetched on demand by
# experiments/tfpt-discovery/macro_quantization_probe.py -- sources documented in the script)
experiments/tfpt-discovery/data_macro/

# Large zero caches for the tfpt-discovery RH-reduction probes (~160 MB verified-zero
# npy + ~14 MB Odlyzko zeros6 table; rebuilt on demand by
# experiments/tfpt-discovery/w2_big_zero_cache_build.py / j16_zero_cache_build.py --
# the small npy caches and meta JSONs stay tracked)
experiments/tfpt-discovery/verified_zeros_big.npy
experiments/tfpt-discovery/odlyzko_zeros6.gz

